---
import DsLayout from "../../../layouts/DsLayout.astro";
import CodeBlock from "../../../components/ds/CodeBlock.astro";
---

<DsLayout
  section="Patterns"
  title="Nav and footer"
  lead="The frame around every page: a sticky nav with a full-screen menu, and a footer that repeats the main routes."
>
  <section aria-labelledby="usage">
    <h2 id="usage">Usage</h2>
    <p class="ds-text">Every page on the main site uses both. Raw pages (the golf trip, the apartment) and field experiments may opt out.</p>
    <CodeBlock
      code={`---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Page | Ryan Sheridan">
  <Nav />
  <main id="main">…</main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>`}
    />
    <p class="ds-text">Give the page's <code>&lt;main&gt;</code> <code>id="main"</code>. The skip link in the layout points at it.</p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="nav">
    <h2 id="nav">Nav</h2>
    <div class="ds-table-wrap">
      <table class="ds-table">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Part</th><th scope="col">Spec</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Bar</td><td>Sticky, <code>--nav-height</code> (64px): 8px padding around a 48px menu button. White, on <code>--z-nav</code>.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Logo</td><td>"ryan sheridan design," lowercase mono, <code>--text-s</code>. Links home.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Menu button</td><td>48px target, two 20px bars that cross into an X when open. Labeled "Menu," then "Close menu."</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Menu</td><td>Full screen, centered links at <code>--text-h3</code>, 16px apart. Fades over <code>--duration-moderate</code>.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <h3>Behavior</h3>
    <ul class="ds-list">
      <li>Closed, the menu is <code>inert</code>: its links are out of the tab order and hidden from screen readers.</li>
      <li>Escape closes it and returns focus to the menu button. So does choosing a link.</li>
      <li>The page behind it stops scrolling while it's open.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="footer">
    <h2 id="footer">Footer</h2>
    <div class="ds-table-wrap">
      <table class="ds-table">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Part</th><th scope="col">Spec</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Frame</td><td>Hairline on top. 64px padding above, 48 below, 120 from the page above it (80 on phones).</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Top row</td><td>Logo left, links right in 13px mono, 32px apart. Stacks under 640px.</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Bottom row</td><td>Copyright in 13px mono, muted. The year updates at build.</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="content">
    <h2 id="content">Content</h2>
    <ul class="ds-list">
      <li>Menu items are one word, the page's short name: Home, Work, About, Contact.</li>
      <li>External links end in ↗ and announce that they open a new tab.</li>
      <li>Keep the menu and footer lists in the same order.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</DsLayout>
